# REQUIRED, with no defaults. Docker Compose sets both for the container.
# Running outside Docker, export them in your shell: uvicorn does not read this file.
# A link is a base URL, http://<host>:<port>.
#
# ai-layer, for the extraction step's LLM call.
# AI_LAYER_URL=
# pim-agent, for labeling extracted fragments against the real PIM concepts.
# PIM_AGENT_URL=
